OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at commercial
OL,4,Apoultry site
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk's second case of bird flu this
OL,7,Fautumn has been confirmed in commercial
OL,8,Fpoultry.
OL,10,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,11,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said a case
OL,12,Fof the H5N1 virus had been found near
OL,13,FDereham in the Breckland area of
OL,14,FNorfolk on Thursday.
OL,16,FA 1.9 mile (3km) protection zone and
OL,17,F6.2 mile (10km) surveillance zone have
OL,18,Fbeen declared around the premises and
OL,19,Fall poultry on the site will be
OL,20,Fhumanely culled.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
